dlP_qf95PY_Hw3gDmQQqNxSmYbEpUr2Q9GeWaXLcr3nMABN-7xaxfMYAc_7fFZpDfs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyrS1h0lPcWBG013jw6gcFCq3JnPJS3a3fHdhiDFfnSVQ&oe=69BC04B7"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7nGGzOr4TOwQ7kNvwGo5BtJ&_nc_oc=Admg1xr0UFh7gz2meeJXOkAAKmWYYB-pR0olQN716jidHH7GMvYl1kBj8Z6Tl-QYAQ4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwjDlbbH7EsgixDJ3fLQ-o7XefM_WEETOW0B1tDWifv7g&oe=69BC064A"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kwik7HmvqiYQ7kNvwEcQazk&_nc_oc=Adnpgdmm5cI6dC9V5fHz-92LkdeSW75YZT1hwXgBwddxG6AW1GWkMKu-uALByRgf2yQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afz1SAiu0Ogaa-nc_rkYkbToyEQx5pLf1CGzok4_5rVcVA&oe=69BBF36F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZRcQ7q9Ds6EQ7kNvwE7-rcN&_nc_oc=AdlLrvcTCya-cw-wTKudThce6V0JgKllVnuo6ulC3EUc_c_6noCeJgwRZw3GR0FtTsg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzLFOo8Pd5kMw_DC6PIMT9WqrMEKHGRMtVykc-yh_mglA&oe=69BBDCC3"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_7c2XT1lfQ0Q7kNvwGWWcTy&_nc_oc=AdkZlFD_Kjs2DzgAUo0L3EAymuWBgJWJFgMngptuMX_G941GXJZJ5M78aqGYd_A3KM4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfynjdWosror7mriqHI9QHMsWm01GF9et0x5DXdbisiysA&oe=69BC0D58"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8YeVhwjeHAUQ7kNvwFOz79l&_nc_oc=AdmPWYcItLNEdOzUudacvJk7WklLPC8l139-z7LQPvovLxjbNThPB5ZWPhyuiOE-6J4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxEGl-NZ185tNNw9f5_h0tekvbe3vhImR3Dgezq9U6ERg&oe=69BBE83C"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_6208099537495751086_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&