2131092734129191", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622166_2131092737462524_8680641054341149174_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fSFyhaoG6osQ7kNvwH-QA8q&_nc_oc=AdlP_qf95PY_Hw3gDmQQqNxSmYbEpUr2Q9GeWaXLcr3nMABN-7xaxfMYAc_7fFZpDfs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyrS1h0lPcWBG013jw6gcFCq3JnPJS3a3fHdhiDFfnSVQ&oe=69BC04B7"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7nGGzOr4TOwQ7kNvwGo5BtJ&_nc_oc=Admg1xr0UFh7gz2meeJXOkAAKmWYYB-pR0olQN716jidHH7GMvYl1kBj8Z6Tl-QYAQ4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwjDlbbH7EsgixDJ3fLQ-o7XefM_WEETOW0B1tDWifv7g&oe=69BC064A"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kwik7HmvqiYQ7kNvwEcQazk&_nc_oc=Adnpgdmm5cI6dC9V5fHz-92LkdeSW75YZT1hwXgBwddxG6AW1GWkMKu-uALByRgf2yQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afz1SAiu0Ogaa-nc_rkYkbToyEQx5pLf1CGzok4_5rVcVA&oe=69BBF36F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current 